WEBVTT

00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:08.630
The Second Wave has passed, and the year 2358 is about to end.

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:13.090
It's been three months since I came to the Stellvia...

00:00:14.050 --> 00:00:16.190
...and there have been so many things that have happened to me...

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:18.590
...that it's difficult to look back on them all.

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:23.300
That's why, right now, I want to feel things.

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:28.540
Feel them, right now, as I get carried along.

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:36.890
Sora wo aogi Hoshi yo michite Tobitatsu no Asu e no brilliant road

